 * Sheets are created automatically: USERS, STUDENTS, Form Payment, FEES PAYMENT,
 * PROGRAMME FEES, ACOUNT NUMBER, EXPENDITURE, RECYCLE BIN, AUDIT LOG
 * Deploy: Deploy > New deployment > Web app > Execute as: Me > Who has access: Anyone
 */
