    total + '</div></div><p>The amount payable now is the initial tuition due shown above. Please pay only through a payment channel officially confirmed by the institute. If any amount is marked “Pending fee setup” or “Not configured,” contact the Finance Office for written confirmation before making that payment. Keep this fee schedule and each payment receipt with this letter for your records.</p>' +
